  "note": "The original client played a hub's ambient_library set as a playlist: the first track when the set changed, each once, then the next (SoundMaster.as changeAmbientSet 474-499, onSoundComplete 616-640). A street's geometry.music_file loops its one recording instead (location.js 481-482, announce_music 999). Every library is Tiny Speck's own recordings again (Sounds.zip, a fan re-upload of the c2.glitch.bz sound files; 2026-11-02): order 'library' themes play that way. The other themes (subway, Enchanted Wood, meditation, the Rook, Eesti, the lively party) still stand in with Tiny Speck's downloads-page music, the archive.org ringtones (Meditation (Round Two in Seven) = MEDITATIVE_ARTS_01, Goodnight Groddle, the Musicblock tunes) and the archive.org sfx ROOK_FLOCK / ROOK_ATTACK; each loops one track picked by hub.",
